        "text_RjtxHm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer specific furniture supply services for our trade and commercial customers. Whether you would like to stock Case Furniture products in your store or specify a product for a project, we’d be happy to help. Please contact<a href=\"mailto:sales@casefurniture.com\" target=\"_blank\">sales@casefurniture.com</a>or call<a href=\"tel:02088704488\" target=\"_blank\">0208 870 4488</a>to set up an account or discuss any trade enquiry in more detail. Alternatively, fill out the form below with details of your requirements, and a member of our dedicated sales team will be in touch with you shortly.</p>",
