            "heading": "Wholesale",
            "heading_size": "text-2xl lg:text-3xl",
            "text": "<p>Through experienced large-volume production, strong global manufacturing and a large distribution network, Case is sold worldwide through direct channels and esteemed retailers. We build long lasting relationships, working with our retailers to meet their specific needs.</p>",
